msgstr "След това добавете :guilabel:`Описание` за този групов трансфер."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/cluster.rst:138
msgid ""
"To create draft batch pickings to be confirmed at a later date, select the "
