"barcode, and other shipping information."
msgstr ""
"Етикет на превозвача за FedEx, съдържащ адреса на получателя, проследяващия "
"номер, баркода и друга информация за доставката."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:245
msgid ":doc:`Print carrier labels <../setup_configuration/labels>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Отпечатване на етикети на превозвача <../setup_configuration/labels>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:250
msgid "Export document"
msgstr "Експортен документ"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:252
msgid ""
"An *export document*, required by customs to ship packages from one country "
"to another, can be automatically printed in Odoo by following these steps:"
msgstr ""
"*Експортен документ*, изискван от митниците за изпращане на пратки от една "
"страна в друга, може да се отпечатва автоматично в Odoo, като изпълните "
"следните стъпки:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:255
msgid ""
"Tick the :guilabel:`Export Documents` checkbox in the :ref:`operation type "
"settings <inventory/shipping_receiving/print_setup>`."
msgstr ""
"Поставете отметка в квадратчето :guilabel:`Export Documents` в "
":ref:`настройките на типа операция "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/print_setup>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:258
msgid "Assign the export document to the printer."
msgstr "Присвояване на експортния документ към принтера."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:263
msgid ""
"Similar to the :ref:`printer assignment instructions for carrier labels "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/assign-printer>`, after connecting a "
"compatible printer to the Odoo *IoT* app, go to :menuselection:`IoT app --> "
"Devices`, and select the desired printer."
msgstr ""
"Подобно на :ref:`инструкциите за присвояване на принтер за етикети на "
"превозвача <inventory/shipping_receiving/assign-printer>`, след свързването "
"на съвместим принтер към приложението *IoT* на Odoo, отидете на "
":menuselection:`IoT app --> Devices` и изберете желания принтер."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:267
msgid ""
"In the printer configuration form, go to the :guilabel:`Printer Reports` "
"tab, and click :guilabel:`Add a line`. In the :guilabel:`Add: Reports` pop-"
"up window that appears, add the :guilabel:`Shipping Documents` report to "
"assign the export document to the printer."
msgstr ""
"Във формуляра за конфигурация на принтера отидете в раздела "
":guilabel:`Printer Reports` и кликнете върху :guilabel:`Add a line`. В "
"изскачащия прозорец :guilabel:`Add: Reports`, който се появява, добавете "
"отчета :guilabel:`Shipping Documents`, за да присвоите експортния документ "
"към принтера."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:0
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:277
msgid "Export document for a shipment from the USA to Belgium."
msgstr "Експортен документ за пратка от САЩ до Белгия."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:282
msgid "Package content"
msgstr "Съдържание на пакета"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:284
msgid ""
"A *package content* PDF includes the package's barcode, packed date, along "
"with a list of contained products and quantities."
msgstr ""
"PDF файлът *съдържание на пакета* включва баркода на пакета, датата на "
"пакетиране, както и списък на съдържащите се продукти и количества."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:287
msgid ""
"To print this form automatically, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Operation Types`, and select the desired operation type. "
"Then, go to the :guilabel:`Hardware` tab, and tick the :guilabel:`Package "
"Contents` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"За да отпечатвате автоматично този формуляр, отидете на "
":menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Operation Types` и "
"изберете желания тип операция. След това отидете в раздела "
":guilabel:`Hardware` и поставете отметка в квадратчето :guilabel:`Package "
"Contents`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:292
msgid ""
"If the option is not available, enable the :doc:`Packages "
"<../../product_management/configure/package>` feature, by going to "
":menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`, ticking the "
":guilabel:`Packages` checkbox, and clicking :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Ако опцията не е налична, активирайте функцията :doc:`Packages "
"<../../product_management/configure/package>`, като отидете на "
":menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`, поставите "
"отметка в квадратчето :guilabel:`Packages` и кликнете върху "
":guilabel:`Save`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:297
msgid ""
"After enabling the feature in the :guilabel:`Hardware` tab, validating the "
"operation prints a PDF of the package contents."
msgstr ""
"След активиране на функцията в раздела :guilabel:`Hardware`, валидирането на"
" операцията отпечатва PDF на съдържанието на пакета."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:0
msgid ""
"Package contents form showing the package contents, barcode, and pack date."
msgstr ""
"Формуляр за съдържанието на пакета, показващ съдържанието на пакета, баркода"
" и датата на пакетиране."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:306
msgid "Package contents showing the package contents, barcode, and pack date."
msgstr ""
"Съдържание на пакета, показващо съдържанието на пакета, баркода и датата на "
"пакетиране."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:311
msgid "Package label"
msgstr "Етикет на пакета"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:313
msgid ""
"A *package label* that shows the package's barcode and pack date can be "
"configured to print upon clicking the *Put in Pack* button."
msgstr ""
"*Етикет на пакета*, който показва баркода на пакета и датата на пакетиране, "
"може да се конфигурира да се отпечатва при кликване върху бутона *Put in "
"Pack*."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:317
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Put in Pack` button is available **only** when the "
":doc:`Packages <../../product_management/configure/package>` feature is "
"enabled in :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"Бутонът :guilabel:`Put in Pack` е наличен **само** когато функцията "
":doc:`Packages <../../product_management/configure/package>` е активирана в "
":menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:321
msgid ""
"After it is enabled, the :guilabel:`Put in Pack` button is available on all "
"inventory operations (e.g. receipt, pickings, internal transfers, delivery "
"orders, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"След активирането ѝ бутонът :guilabel:`Put in Pack` е наличен за всички "
"складови операции (напр. получаване, товарения, вътрешни премествания, "
"поръчки за доставка и др.)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:324
msgid ""
"To automatically print the package label when the :guilabel:`Put in Pack` "
"button is clicked, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration -->"
" Operation Types`. Select the desired operation type, and tick the "
":guilabel:`Package Label` checkbox in the :guilabel:`Hardware` tab. Labels "
"can be printed in :guilabel:`PDF` or :guilabel:`ZPL` file formats, as "
"defined in the :guilabel:`Print label as` field."
msgstr ""
"За автоматично отпечатване на етикета на пакета при кликване върху бутона "
":guilabel:`Put in Pack`, отидете на :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Operation Types`. Изберете желания тип операция и "
"поставете отметка в квадратчето :guilabel:`Package Label` в раздела "
":guilabel:`Hardware`. Етикетите могат да се отпечатват във файлови формати "
":guilabel:`PDF` или :guilabel:`ZPL`, както е зададено в полето "
":guilabel:`Print label as`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:0
msgid "PDF of package barcode and package date."
msgstr "PDF на баркода на пакета и датата на пакета."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:3
msgid "Sendcloud integration"
msgstr "Интеграция със Sendcloud"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:5
msgid ""
"Sendcloud is a shipping service aggregator that facilitates the integration "
"of European shipping carriers with Odoo. Once integrated, users can select "
"shipping carriers on inventory operations in their Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Sendcloud е агрегатор на транспортни услуги, който улеснява интеграцията на "
"европейски куриерски компании с Odoo. След интегрирането потребителите могат"
" да избират куриерски компании за складовите операции в базата данни на "
"Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:10
msgid "Setup in Sendcloud"
msgstr "Настройка в Sendcloud"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:15
msgid ""
"To get started, `create or log in to a Sendcloud account "
"<https://account.sendcloud.com/signup/ "
"?utm_source=odoo&utm_medium=partnerships&utm_campaign=partner_integrations_page>`_."
msgstr ""
"За да започнете, `създайте или влезте в акаунт в Sendcloud "
"<https://account.sendcloud.com/signup/ "
"?utm_source=odoo&utm_medium=partnerships&utm_campaign=partner_integrations_page>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:18
msgid ""
"On the Sendcloud platform, follow the `Sendcloud integration documentation "
"<https://support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/360059470491-Odoo-Native-"
"integration>`_ to configure the account and generate the connector "
"credentials."
msgstr ""
"На платформата Sendcloud следвайте `документацията за интеграция на "
"Sendcloud <https://support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/360059470491-Odoo-Native-integration>`_, за да конфигурирате "
"акаунта и генерирате идентификационните данни на конектора."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:23
msgid ""
"For new account creation, Sendcloud will ask for a :abbr:`VAT (Value-Added "
"Tax Identification)` number or :abbr:`EORI (Economic Operators' Registration"
" and Identification)` number. After completing the account setup, activate "
"(or deactivate) the shipping carriers that will be used in the Odoo "
"database."
msgstr ""
"За създаването на нов акаунт Sendcloud ще поиска номер :abbr:`VAT (Value-"
"Added Tax Identification)` или номер :abbr:`EORI (Economic Operators' "
"Registration and Identification)`. След завършване на настройката на акаунта"
" активирайте (или деактивирайте) куриерските компании, които ще се използват"
" в базата данни на Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:29
msgid ""
"Odoo integration of Sendcloud works on free Sendcloud plans *only* if a bank"
" account is linked, since Sendcloud won't ship for free. To use shipping "
"rules, or individual custom carrier contacts, a paid plan of Sendcloud is "
"**required**."
msgstr ""
"Интеграцията на Odoo със Sendcloud работи с безплатните планове на Sendcloud"
" *само* ако е свързана банкова сметка, тъй като Sendcloud не извършва "
"безплатни доставки. За използване на правила за доставка или индивидуални "
"персонализирани контакти с превозвачи е **необходим** платен план на "
"Sendcloud."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:36
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:185
msgid "Warehouse configuration"
msgstr "Конфигурация на склада"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:38
msgid ""
"Once logged into the Sendcloud account, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings"
" --> Shipping --> Addresses`, and fill in the field for :guilabel:`Warehouse"
" address`."
msgstr ""
"След влизане в акаунта в Sendcloud отидете на :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Shipping --> Addresses` и попълнете полето :guilabel:`Warehouse address`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:None
msgid "Adding addresses in the Sendcloud settings."
msgstr "Добавяне на адреси в настройките на Sendcloud."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:45
msgid ""
"To allow Sendcloud to process returns as well, a :guilabel:`Return Address` "
"is required. Under the :guilabel:`Miscellaneous section`, there is a field "
"called :guilabel:`Address Name (optional)`. The Odoo warehouse name should "
"be entered here, and the characters should be exactly the same."
msgstr ""
"За да позволите на Sendcloud да обработва и връщания, е необходим "
":guilabel:`Return Address`. В раздела :guilabel:`Miscellaneous section` има "
"поле, наречено :guilabel:`Address Name (optional)`. Тук трябва да се въведе "
"името на склада от Odoo, като символите трябва да бъдат абсолютно еднакви."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid "**SendClould configuration**"
msgstr "**Конфигурация в SendClould**"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Miscellaneous`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Miscellaneous`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Address Name (optional)`: `Warehouse #1`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Address Name (optional)`: `Warehouse #1`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Brand`: `Default`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Brand`: `Default`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid "**Odoo warehouse configuration**"
msgstr "**Конфигурация на склад в Odoo**"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Warehouse`: `Warehouse #1`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Warehouse`: `Warehouse #1`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Short Name`: `WH`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Short Name`: `WH`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Company`: `My company (San Francisco)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Company`: `My company (San Francisco)`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Address`: `My Company (San Francisco)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Address`: `My Company (San Francisco)`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:62
msgid ""
"Notice how the inputs for the :guilabel:`Warehouse` field, for both the Odoo"
" configuration and the Sendcloud configuration, are the exact same."
msgstr ""
"Обърнете внимание как въведените стойности за полето :guilabel:`Warehouse`, "
"както за конфигурацията в Odoo, така и за конфигурацията в Sendcloud, са "
"абсолютно еднакви."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:66
msgid "Generate Sendcloud credentials"
msgstr "Генериране на идентификационни данни за Sendcloud"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:68
msgid ""
"In the Sendcloud account, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Integrations` in the menu on the right. Next, search for :guilabel:`Odoo "
"Native`. Then, click on :guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr ""
"В акаунта в Sendcloud отидете на :menuselection:`Settings --> Integrations` "
"в менюто вдясно. След това потърсете :guilabel:`Odoo Native`. После кликнете"
" върху :guilabel:`Connect`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:71
msgid ""
"After clicking on :guilabel:`Connect`, the page redirects to the "
":guilabel:`Sendcloud API` settings page, where the :guilabel:`Public and "
"Secret Keys` are produced. The next step is to name the "
":guilabel:`Integration`. The naming convention is as follows: `Odoo "
"CompanyName`, with the user's company name replacing `CompanyName` (e.g. "
"`Odoo StealthyWood`)."
msgstr ""
"След кликване върху :guilabel:`Connect` страницата пренасочва към страницата"
" с настройки :guilabel:`Sendcloud API`, където се генерират "
":guilabel:`Public and Secret Keys`. Следващата стъпка е да наименувате "
":guilabel:`Integration`. Конвенцията за наименуване е следната: `Odoo "
"CompanyName`, като името на фирмата на потребителя замества `CompanyName` "
"(напр. `Odoo StealthyWood`)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:76
msgid ""
"Then, check the box next to :guilabel:`Service Points` and select the "
"shipping services for this integration. After saving, the :guilabel:`Public "
"and Secret Keys` are generated."
msgstr ""
"След това поставете отметка до :guilabel:`Service Points` и изберете "
"услугите за доставка за тази интеграция. След запазване се генерират "
":guilabel:`Public and Secret Keys`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:None
msgid "Configuring the Sendcloud integration and receiving the credentials."
msgstr ""
"Конфигуриране на интеграцията със Sendcloud и получаване на "
"идентификационните данни."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:86
msgid ""
"To ensure seamless Sendcloud integration with Odoo, :ref:`install "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/sendcloud-module>` and :ref:`link "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/link-sendcloud-module>` the Sendcloud shipping"
" connector to the Sendcloud account. Then, :ref:`configure Odoo fields "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/sendcloud-shipping-info>`, so Sendcloud can "
"accurately pull shipping data to generate labels."
msgstr ""
"За да осигурите безпроблемна интеграция на Sendcloud с Odoo, "
":ref:`инсталирайте <inventory/shipping_receiving/sendcloud-module>` и "
":ref:`свържете <inventory/shipping_receiving/link-sendcloud-module>` "
"конектора за доставка на Sendcloud с акаунта в Sendcloud. След това "
":ref:`конфигурирайте полетата в Odoo "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/sendcloud-shipping-info>`, за да може "
"Sendcloud точно да извлича данните за доставка за генериране на етикети."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:94
msgid ""
":ref:`Enable pickup points on websites "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/sendcloud-pickups>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Активиране на пунктове за получаване на уебсайтове "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/sendcloud-pickups>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:99
msgid "Install Sendcloud shipping module"
msgstr "Инсталиране на модула за доставка Sendcloud"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:101
msgid ""
"After the Sendcloud account is set up and configured, it's time to configure"
" the Odoo database. To get started, go to Odoo's :guilabel:`Apps` module, "
"search for the `Sendcloud Shipping` integration, and install it."
msgstr ""
"След като акаунтът в Sendcloud е настроен и конфигуриран, е време да "
"конфигурирате базата данни на Odoo. За да започнете, отидете на модула "
":guilabel:`Apps` на Odoo, потърсете интеграцията `Sendcloud Shipping` и я "
"инсталирайте."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:None
msgid "Sendcloud Shipping module in the Odoo Apps module."
msgstr "Модул Sendcloud Shipping в модула Apps на Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:112
msgid "Sendcloud shipping connector configuration"
msgstr "Конфигурация на конектора за доставка Sendcloud"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:114
msgid ""
"Once installed, activate the :guilabel:`Sendcloud Shipping` module in "
":menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`. The "
":guilabel:`Sendcloud Connector` setting is found under the "
":guilabel:`Shipping Connectors` section."
msgstr ""
"След инсталирането активирайте модула :guilabel:`Sendcloud Shipping` в "
":menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`. Настройката "
":guilabel:`Sendcloud Connector` се намира в раздела :guilabel:`Shipping "
"Connectors`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:118
msgid ""
"After activating the :guilabel:`Sendcloud Connector`, click on the "
":guilabel:`Sendcloud Shipping Methods` link below the listed connector. Once"
" on the :guilabel:`Shipping Methods` page, click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"След активиране на :guilabel:`Sendcloud Connector` кликнете върху връзката "
":guilabel:`Sendcloud Shipping Methods` под изброения конектор. След като сте"
" на страницата :guilabel:`Shipping Methods`, кликнете върху :guilabel:`New`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:123
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Shipping Methods` can also be accessed by going to "
":menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Delivery --> Shipping "
"Methods`."
msgstr ""
"До :guilabel:`Shipping Methods` може да се стигне и чрез "
":menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Delivery --> Shipping "
"Methods`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:126
msgid ""
"Fill out the following fields in the :guilabel:`New Shipping Method` form:"
msgstr ""
"Попълнете следните полета във формуляра :guilabel:`New Shipping Method`:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:128
msgid ":guilabel:`Shipping Method`: type `Sendcloud DPD`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Shipping Method`: въведете `Sendcloud DPD`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:129
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Provider`: select :guilabel:`Sendcloud` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Provider`: изберете :guilabel:`Sendcloud` от падащото меню."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Product`: set the product that was configured for this "
"shipping method or create a new product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Product`: задайте продукта, който е конфигуриран за този"
" метод за доставка, или създайте нов продукт."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:132
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`SendCloud Configuration` tab, enter the "
":guilabel:`Sendcloud Public Key`."
msgstr ""
"В раздела :guilabel:`SendCloud Configuration` въведете :guilabel:`Sendcloud "
"Public Key`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:133
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`SendCloud Configuration` tab, enter the "
":guilabel:`Sendcloud Secret Key`."
msgstr ""
"В раздела :guilabel:`SendCloud Configuration` въведете :guilabel:`Sendcloud "
"Secret Key`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:138
msgid "Pickup points"
msgstr "Пунктове за получаване"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:140
msgid ""
"Sendcloud's `service point delivery <https://support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/360026097951-FAQ-Service-Points>`_ lets customers choose a "
"pickup location (such as a nearby shop or locker) instead of entering a "
"private delivery address."
msgstr ""
"`Доставката до сервизна точка <https://support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/360026097951-FAQ-Service-Points>`_ на Sendcloud позволява на "
"клиентите да изберат място за получаване (например близък магазин или шкаф "
"за пратки) вместо да въвеждат частен адрес за доставка."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:145
msgid ""
"To enable the feature, go to the shipping method form, and in the "
":guilabel:`SendCloud Configuration` tab, under the :guilabel:`Options` "
"section, enable :guilabel:`Use Sendcloud Locations` feature."
msgstr ""
"За да активирате функцията, отидете във формуляра на метода за доставка и в "
"раздела :guilabel:`SendCloud Configuration`, в секцията :guilabel:`Options`,"
" активирайте функцията :guilabel:`Use Sendcloud Locations`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:150
msgid ""
"Pickup point selection is only available through the **Website** app (the "
"online checkout view). It is not currently possible to select a pickup point"
" manually through the **Sales** app (the internal database view)."
msgstr ""
"Изборът на пункт за получаване е наличен само през приложението **Website** "
"(изгледът за онлайн плащане). В момента не е възможно ръчно избиране на "
"пункт за получаване през приложението **Sales** (изгледът на вътрешната база"
" данни)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:154
msgid ""
"For example, if the customer selects a shipping method like *Sendcloud "
"Mondial Relay*, they must choose a pickup point during the checkout process "
"on the website. If no pickup point is selected, the delivery order cannot be"
" validated in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Например, ако клиентът избере метод за доставка като *Sendcloud Mondial "
"Relay*, той трябва да избере пункт за получаване по време на процеса на "
"плащане на уебсайта. Ако не е избран пункт за получаване, поръчката за "
"доставка не може да бъде валидирана в Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:159
msgid "Load shipping products"
msgstr "Зареждане на продукти за доставка"

