#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:None
msgid "Example of shipping products configured in Odoo."
msgstr "Пример за продукти за доставка, конфигурирани в Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:195
msgid ""
"Sendcloud does not provide test keys when a company tests the sending of a "
"package in Odoo. This means if a package is created, the configured "
"Sendcloud account will be charged, unless the associated package is "
"cancelled within 24 hours of creation."
msgstr ""
"Sendcloud не предоставя тестови ключове, когато фирма тества изпращането на "
"пратка в Odoo. Това означава, че ако бъде създадена пратка, конфигурираният "
"акаунт в Sendcloud ще бъде таксуван, освен ако свързаната пратка не бъде "
"отменена в рамките на 24 часа от създаването ѝ."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:199
msgid ""
"Odoo has a built-in layer of protection against unwanted charges when using "
"test environments. Within a test environment, if a shipping method is used "
"to create labels, then those labels are immediately cancelled after the "
"creation — this occurs automatically. The test and production environment "
"settings can be toggled back and forth from their respective smart buttons."
msgstr ""
"Odoo разполага с вградено ниво на защита срещу нежелани такси при използване"
" на тестови среди. В тестова среда, ако метод за доставка се използва за "
"създаване на етикети, тези етикети незабавно се отменят след създаването им "
"— това се случва автоматично. Настройките за тестова и продукционна среда "
"могат да се превключват от съответните им интелигентни бутони."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:209
msgid ""
"To use Sendcloud to generate shipping labels, the following information "
"**must** be filled out accurately and completely in Odoo:"
msgstr ""
"За да използвате Sendcloud за генериране на етикети за доставка, следната "
"информация **трябва** да бъде попълнена точно и изцяло в Odoo:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:212
msgid ""
"**Customer information**: when creating a quotation, ensure the selected "
":guilabel:`Customer` has a valid phone number, email address, and shipping "
"address."
msgstr ""
"**Информация за клиента**: при създаване на оферта се уверете, че избраният "
":guilabel:`Customer` има валиден телефонен номер, имейл адрес и адрес за "
"доставка."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:219
msgid ""
"**Product weight**: ensure all products in an order have a specified "
":guilabel:`Weight` in the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab of their product form. "
"Refer to the :ref:`Product weight section "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-weight>` of this article for "
"detailed instructions."
msgstr ""
"**Тегло на продукта**: уверете се, че всички продукти в поръчката имат "
"посочено :guilabel:`Weight` в раздела :guilabel:`Inventory` на формуляра на "
"продукта. Вижте раздела :ref:`Тегло на продукта "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-weight>` от тази статия за подробни "
"инструкции."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:223
msgid ""
"**Warehouse address**: ensure the warehouse name and address in Odoo match "
"the :ref:`previously defined warehouse "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/sendcloud-warehouse-config>` in the Sendcloud "
"setup. For details on warehouse configuration in Odoo, refer to the "
":ref:`warehouse configuration section "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-source-address>` of the third-party "
"shipping documentation."
msgstr ""
"**Адрес на склада**: уверете се, че името и адресът на склада в Odoo "
"съвпадат с :ref:`предварително дефинирания склад "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/sendcloud-warehouse-config>` в настройката на "
"Sendcloud. За подробности относно конфигурацията на склад в Odoo вижте "
"раздела :ref:`конфигурация на склада "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-source-address>` от документацията "
"за външни доставчици на превоз."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:230
msgid "Generate labels with Sendcloud"
msgstr "Генериране на етикети със Sendcloud"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:232
msgid ""
"When creating a quotation in Odoo, add shipping and a :guilabel:`Sendcloud "
"shipping product`. Then, :guilabel:`Validate` the delivery. Shipping label "
"documents are automatically generated in the chatter, which include the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"При създаване на оферта в Odoo добавете доставка и :guilabel:`Sendcloud "
"shipping product`. След това валидирайте доставката чрез "
":guilabel:`Validate`. Документите за етикети за доставка се генерират "
"автоматично в чатъра, като включват следното:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:237
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Return label(s)` if the Sendcloud connector is configured for "
"returns."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Return label(s)`, ако конекторът на Sendcloud е конфигуриран за "
"връщания."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:238
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customs document(s)` should the destination country require them."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Митнически документ(и)`, ако страната на местоназначение ги "
"изисква."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:243
msgid ""
"When return labels are created, Sendcloud automatically charges the "
"configured Sendcloud account."
msgstr ""
"Когато се създават етикети за връщане, Sendcloud автоматично начислява "
"сумата на конфигурирания акаунт в Sendcloud."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:246
msgid "Shipping rules"
msgstr "Правила за доставка"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:248
msgid ""
"Optionally, create shipping rules to automatically generate shipping labels "
"tailored to different product needs. For example, a shipping rule can be "
"created for customers shipping expensive jewelry items to purchase "
"insurance."
msgstr ""
"По желание можете да създадете правила за доставка, които автоматично "
"генерират етикети за доставка, съобразени с различните нужди на продуктите. "
"Например може да се създаде правило за доставка за клиенти, изпращащи скъпи "
"бижута, за закупуване на застраховка."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:253
msgid ""
"Shipping rules do **not** affect :ref:`shipping rate calculations "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/third-party-rate>`, and are only used to "
"improve the process of :doc:`generating shipping labels <labels>`."
msgstr ""
"Правилата за доставка **не** влияят на :ref:`изчисленията на тарифите за "
"доставка <inventory/shipping_receiving/third-party-rate>` и се използват "
"само за подобряване на процеса на :doc:`генериране на етикети за доставка "
"<labels>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:257
msgid ""
"To use shipping rules, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Delivery: Shipping Methods`, and select the intended "
"`Sendcloud` shipping method."
msgstr ""
"За да използвате правила за доставка, отидете на :menuselection:`Складова "
"наличност --> Конфигуриране --> Доставка: Методи на доставка` и изберете "
"желания метод на доставка `Sendcloud`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:260
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Sendcloud Configuration` tab, in the "
":guilabel:`OPTIONS` section, choose the kind of shipments the shipping rules"
" apply to, via the :guilabel:`Use Sendcloud shipping rules` field."
msgstr ""
"В раздела :guilabel:`Конфигурация на Sendcloud` в секцията :guilabel:`ОПЦИИ`"
" изберете вида пратки, за които се прилагат правилата за доставка, чрез "
"полето :guilabel:`Използване на правила за доставка на Sendcloud`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:264
msgid ""
"From here, choose either: :guilabel:`Shipping` to customers, "
":guilabel:`Returns` from customers, or :guilabel:`Both`."
msgstr ""
"Оттук изберете едно от следните: :guilabel:`Доставка` към клиенти, "
":guilabel:`Връщания` от клиенти, или :guilabel:`И двете`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:None
msgid "Use Shipping Rules field."
msgstr "Полето за използване на правила за доставка."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:271
msgid ""
"Then, in the Sendcloud website, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Shipping rules`. Create a new shipping rule by clicking :guilabel:`Create "
"New`."
msgstr ""
"След това, в уебсайта на Sendcloud, отидете на :menuselection:`Настройки -->"
" Правила за доставка`. Създайте ново правило за доставка, като кликнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Създаване на ново`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:274
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Actions` section, set a :guilabel:`Condition` to determine"
" when the rule applies. Then, configure what to do when packages meet the "
"condition."
msgstr ""
"В секцията :guilabel:`Действия` задайте :guilabel:`Условие`, за да "
"определите кога се прилага правилото. След това конфигурирайте какво да се "
"случва, когато пакетите отговарят на условието."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:278
msgid ""
"`Create shipping rules on Sendcloud <https://support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/ 10274470454292-How-to-create-shipping-rules#examples-smart-"
"shipping-rules>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Създаване на правила за доставка в Sendcloud "
"<https://support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/ 10274470454292-How-to-"
"create-shipping-rules#examples-smart-shipping-rules>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:285
msgid "Shipment is too heavy"
msgstr "Пратката е твърде тежка"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:287
msgid ""
"If the shipment is too heavy for the Sendcloud service that is configured, "
"then the weight is split to simulate multiple packages. Products will need "
"to be put in different :guilabel:`Packages` to :guilabel:`Validate` the "
"transfer and generate labels."
msgstr ""
"Ако пратката е твърде тежка за конфигурираната услуга на Sendcloud, теглото "
"се разделя, за да се симулират няколко пакета. Продуктите трябва да бъдат "
"поставени в различни :guilabel:`Пакети`, за да можете да "
":guilabel:`Валидирате` трансфера и да генерирате етикети."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:291
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rules` can also be set up in Sendcloud to use other shipping "
"methods when the weight is too heavy. However, note that these rules will "
"not apply to the shipping price calculation on the calculation on the sales "
"order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Правила` могат също да бъдат настроени в Sendcloud за използване "
"на други методи на доставка, когато теглото е твърде голямо. Имайте предвид "
"обаче, че тези правила няма да се прилагат за изчисляването на цената за "
"доставка в поръчката за продажба."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:296
msgid "Personal carrier contract"
msgstr "Личен договор с превозвач"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:298
msgid ""
"Use custom prices from a direct carrier contract, via CSV upload, by first "
"logging into Sendcloud, navigating to :menuselection:`Settings --> Carriers "
"--> My contracts`, and then selecting the intended contract."
msgstr ""
"Използвайте персонализирани цени от директен договор с превозвач чрез "
"качване на CSV файл, като първо влезете в Sendcloud, отидете на "
":menuselection:`Настройки --> Превозвачи --> Моите договори` и след това "
"изберете желания договор."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:None
msgid "Navigate to the contracts section in Sendcloud."
msgstr "Отидете в секцията за договори в Sendcloud."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:306
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Contract prices` section, click :guilabel:`Download "
"CSV` and fill out the contract prices in the :guilabel:`price` column of the"
" CSV file template."
msgstr ""
"В секцията :guilabel:`Цени по договор` кликнете върху :guilabel:`Изтегляне "
"на CSV` и попълнете цените по договора в колоната :guilabel:`цена` на "
"шаблона на CSV файла."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:310
msgid ""
"Ensure the CSV file includes the correct prices to avoid any inaccuracies."
msgstr ""
"Уверете се, че CSV файлът съдържа правилните цени, за да избегнете "
"неточности."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:None
msgid ""
"Show sample contract CSV from Sendcloud, highlighting the price column."
msgstr ""
"Показва примерен CSV файл с договор от Sendcloud, като е откроена колоната с"
" цени."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:316
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Upload` the completed CSV file to Sendcloud, then click "
":guilabel:`Save these prices`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Качете` попълнения CSV файл в Sendcloud, след което кликнете "
"върху :guilabel:`Запазете тези цени`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:319
msgid ""
"`Sendcloud: How to upload contract prices with carriers "
"<https://support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/5163547066004>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Sendcloud: Как да качите цени по договор с превозвачи "
"<https://support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/5163547066004>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:325
msgid ""
"Many carriers have several measures for weight. There is the actual weight "
"of the products in the parcel, and there is the *volumetric weight* "
"(:dfn:`Volumetric weight is the volume that a package occupies when in "
"transit. In other words it is the physical size of a package`)."
msgstr ""
"Много превозвачи имат няколко мерки за тегло. Съществува действителното "
"тегло на продуктите в пратката, както и *обемно тегло* (:dfn:`Обемното тегло"
" е обемът, който заема пакетът по време на транспортиране. С други думи, "
"това е физическият размер на пакета`)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:330
msgid ""
"Check to see if selected carrier(s) already have defined formulas to compute"
" the volumetric weight."
msgstr ""
"Проверете дали избраният(те) превозвач(и) вече имат дефинирани формули за "
"изчисляване на обемното тегло."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:334
msgid ""
"`Sendcloud: How to calculate & automate parcel volumetric weight "
"<https://support.sendcloud.com/ hc/en-us/articles/360059644051-How-to-"
"calculate-automate-parcel-volumetric-weight>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Sendcloud: Как да изчислите и автоматизирате обемното тегло на пратката "
"<https://support.sendcloud.com/ hc/en-us/articles/360059644051-How-to-"
"calculate-automate-parcel-volumetric-weight>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:338
msgid "Unable to calculate shipping rate"
msgstr "Невъзможност за изчисляване на тарифата за доставка"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:340
msgid ""
"First, verify that the product being shipped has a weight that is supported "
"by the selected shipping method. If this is set, then verify that the "
"destination country (from the customer address) is supported by the carrier."
" The country of origin (warehouse address) should also be supported by the "
"carrier."
msgstr ""
"Първо проверете дали изпращаният продукт има тегло, което се поддържа от "
"избрания метод на доставка. Ако това е зададено, проверете дали страната на "
"местоназначение (от адреса на клиента) се поддържа от превозвача. Страната "
"на произход (адресът на склада) също трябва да се поддържа от превозвача."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:3
msgid "Shiprocket integration"
msgstr "Интеграция с Shiprocket"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:5
msgid ""
"Shiprocket is an Indian service that allows users to connect with multiple "
"carriers, like Delhivery, Blue Dart, DTDC, India Post, Xpressbees, and more."
" To manage Shiprocket shipments to clients directly within Odoo, it must "
"first be configured."
msgstr ""
"Shiprocket е индийска услуга, която позволява на потребителите да се "
"свързват с множество превозвачи, като Delhivery, Blue Dart, DTDC, India "
"Post, Xpressbees и други. За да управлявате пратки чрез Shiprocket до "
"клиенти директно от Odoo, услугата трябва първо да бъде конфигурирана."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:11
msgid ""
":ref:`Create a Shiprocket account <inventory/shiprocket/account-setup>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Създаване на акаунт в Shiprocket <inventory/shiprocket/account-"
"setup>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:12
msgid ":ref:`Create an API user <inventory/shiprocket/api-user>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Създаване на API потребител <inventory/shiprocket/api-user>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:13
msgid ":ref:`Create a sales channel <inventory/shiprocket/sales-channel>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Създаване на канал за продажби <inventory/shiprocket/sales-channel>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:14
msgid ":ref:`Enable couriers <inventory/shiprocket/enable-couriers>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Активиране на куриери <inventory/shiprocket/enable-couriers>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:15
msgid ""
":ref:`Enable the Shiprocket connector in Odoo "
"<inventory/shiprocket/enable>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Активиране на конектора Shiprocket в Odoo "
"<inventory/shiprocket/enable>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:16
msgid ""
":ref:`Configure the delivery method in Odoo "
"<inventory/shiprocket/configure>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Конфигуриране на метода на доставка в Odoo "
"<inventory/shiprocket/configure>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:18
msgid ""
"Upon completion, it is possible to calculate shipping costs based on package"
" size and weight, have the charges applied directly to a Shiprocket account,"
" and automatically print Shiprocket tracking labels in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"След завършването е възможно да се изчисляват разходите за доставка въз "
"основа на размера и теглото на пакета, начисленията да се прилагат директно "
"към акаунт в Shiprocket и автоматично да се отпечатват в Odoo етикети за "
"проследяване на Shiprocket."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:27
msgid ""
"To begin, go to the `Shiprocket website "
"<https://app.shiprocket.in/newlogin>`_ to create or log into the company's "
"Shiprocket account. Follow the website's steps to complete registration."
msgstr ""
"За да започнете, отидете на `уебсайта на Shiprocket "
"<https://app.shiprocket.in/newlogin>`_, за да създадете или влезете в "
"акаунта на компанията в Shiprocket. Следвайте стъпките на уебсайта, за да "
"завършите регистрацията."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:33
msgid "Create API user"
msgstr "Създаване на API потребител"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:35
msgid ""
"On the Shiprocket *Homepage*, open the :menuselection:`Settings` menu. In "
"the *Additional Settings* section, navigate to the :menuselection:`API "
"Users` page."
msgstr ""
"На *началната страница* на Shiprocket отворете менюто "
":menuselection:`Настройки`. В секцията *Допълнителни настройки* отидете на "
"страницата :menuselection:`API потребители`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:38
msgid ""
"On the *API Users* page, click the :guilabel:`+ Add New API User` button. In"
" the *Add New User* window, specify an :guilabel:`Email ID`. Open the "
":guilabel:`Select Modules to Access` menu and select :guilabel:`Orders "
"(create, update)`, :guilabel:`Settings`, :guilabel:`Shipments`, "
":guilabel:`Listings`, and :guilabel:`Courier`, then click :guilabel:`Apply`."
" Finally, click :guilabel:`Create User` to add the user."
msgstr ""
"На страницата *API потребители* кликнете върху бутона :guilabel:`+ Добавяне "
"на нов API потребител`. В прозореца *Добавяне на нов потребител* въведете "
":guilabel:`Имейл ID`. Отворете менюто :guilabel:`Избор на модули за достъп` "
"и изберете :guilabel:`Поръчки (създаване, актуализиране)`, "
":guilabel:`Настройки`, :guilabel:`Пратки`, :guilabel:`Обяви` и "
":guilabel:`Куриер`, след което кликнете върху :guilabel:`Приложи`. Накрая "
"кликнете върху :guilabel:`Създаване на потребител`, за да добавите "
"потребителя."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:44
msgid "Copy the API password from the *Your API Password* window."
msgstr "Копирайте API паролата от прозореца *Вашата API парола*."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:None
msgid ""
"Click the Copy token icon to copy the password to the device's clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Кликнете върху иконата за копиране на токена, за да копирате паролата в "
"клипборда на устройството."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:52
msgid "Create sales channel"
msgstr "Създаване на канал за продажби"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:54
msgid ""
"From the sidebar, navigate to :menuselection:`Setup & Manage --> Channels`. "
"On the *Sales Channels* page, click :guilabel:`Connect New Channel`. In the "
"*Shopping Carts* section, click the :guilabel:`Add` button under the "
"*Manual* heading. The *Manual* settings page opens."
msgstr ""
"От страничната лента отидете на :menuselection:`Настройка и управление --> "
"Канали`. На страницата *Канали за продажби* кликнете върху "
":guilabel:`Свързване на нов канал`. В секцията *Пазарски колички* кликнете "
"върху бутона :guilabel:`Добавяне` под заглавието *Ръчно*. Отваря се "
"страницата с настройки *Ръчно*."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:58
msgid ""
"Specify a :guilabel:`Channel Name`, such as `Odoo`. Click :guilabel:`Save "
"Channel & Test Connection`."
msgstr ""
"Въведете :guilabel:`Име на канал`, например `Odoo`. Кликнете върху "
":guilabel:`Запазване на канал и тестване на връзката`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:None
msgid "Create a sales channel."
msgstr "Създаване на канал за продажби."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:67
msgid "Configure couriers"
msgstr "Конфигуриране на куриери"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:69
msgid ""
"From the sidebar, navigate to :menuselection:`Setup & Manage --> Courier`. "
"On the *Courier Selection* page, enable or disable shipping couriers."
msgstr ""
"От страничната лента отидете на :menuselection:`Настройка и управление --> "
"Куриер`. На страницата *Избор на куриер* активирайте или деактивирайте "
"куриерите за доставка."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:None
msgid "Toggle couriers to select them on the Courier Selection page."
msgstr ""
"Превключете куриерите, за да ги изберете на страницата за избор на куриер."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:75
msgid ""
"Open the :menuselection:`Courier Priority` page. Set a priority ranking to "
"which orders are assigned and click :guilabel:`Save`. The courier is "
"selected in Odoo based on this priority. For example, if "
":guilabel:`Cheapest` is selected, the most cost-effective courier is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Отворете страницата :menuselection:`Приоритет на куриер`. Задайте ранг на "
"приоритет, по който се разпределят поръчките, и кликнете върху "
":guilabel:`Запазване`. Куриерът се избира в Odoo въз основа на този "
"приоритет. Например, ако е избрано :guilabel:`Най-евтин`, се избира най-"
"икономичният куриер."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:82
msgid "Enable connector"
msgstr "Активиране на конектор"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:84
msgid ""
"The *Shiprocket Connector* must be enabled before a shipping method can be "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"*Конекторът Shiprocket* трябва да бъде активиран, преди да може да се "
"конфигурира метод на доставка."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:86
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`. "
"In the *Shipping Connectors* section, enable :guilabel:`Shiprocket "
"Connector`, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Отидете на :menuselection:`Складова наличност --> Конфигуриране --> "
"Настройки`. В секцията *Конектори за доставка* активирайте "
":guilabel:`Конектор Shiprocket`, след което кликнете върху "
":guilabel:`Запазване`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:94
msgid ""
"Configure the Shiprocket delivery method in Odoo by going to "
":menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Delivery Methods`."
msgstr ""
"Конфигурирайте метода на доставка Shiprocket в Odoo, като отидете на "
":menuselection:`Складова наличност --> Конфигуриране --> Методи на "
"доставка`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:97
msgid ""
"On the *Delivery Methods* page, open the :guilabel:`ShipRocket Domestic` "
"shipping method, or click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"На страницата *Методи на доставка* отворете метода на доставка "
":guilabel:`ShipRocket Domestic`, или кликнете върху :guilabel:`Ново`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:100
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Provider` field, select :guilabel:`Shiprocket` from the "
"list of providers. Doing so reveals the *Shiprocket Configuration* tab at "
"the bottom of the form, where Shiprocket credentials are entered."
msgstr ""
"В полето :guilabel:`Доставчик` изберете :guilabel:`Shiprocket` от списъка с "
"доставчици. Това ще покаже раздела *Конфигурация на Shiprocket* в долната "
"част на формуляра, където се въвеждат идентификационните данни за "
"Shiprocket."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:104
msgid ""
"For details to configure the other fields on the shipping method, such as "
":guilabel:`Delivery Product`, refer to the :doc:`new_delivery_method` "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"За подробности относно конфигурирането на другите полета на метода за "
"доставка, като :guilabel:`Delivery Product`, вижте документацията "
":doc:`new_delivery_method`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:108
msgid ""
"To generate Shiprocket shipping labels through Odoo, ensure the "
":guilabel:`Integration Level` option is set to :guilabel:`Get Rate and "
"Create Shipment`."
msgstr ""
"За да генерирате етикети за доставка на Shiprocket чрез Odoo, уверете се, че"
" опцията :guilabel:`Ниво на интеграция` е зададена на :guilabel:`Получаване "
"на тарифа и създаване на пратка`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:112
msgid "Shiprocket Configuration tab"
msgstr "Раздел Конфигурация на Shiprocket"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:114
msgid ""
"Enter the API user email address in the :guilabel:`Shiprocket Email` field. "
"Enter the API password for the user in the :guilabel:`Shiprocket Password` "
"field. Click the :guilabel:`Test Connection` link."
msgstr ""
"Въведете имейл адреса на API потребителя в полето :guilabel:`Имейл за "
"Shiprocket`. Въведете API паролата на потребителя в полето :guilabel:`Парола"
" за Shiprocket`. Кликнете върху връзката :guilabel:`Тестване на връзката`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:118
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Pickup Request` to send a pickup request when a delivery "
"order is validated."
msgstr ""
"Изберете :guilabel:`Заявка за вземане`, за да изпратите заявка за вземане на"
" пратката, когато поръчката за доставка бъде потвърдена."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:120
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Generate Manifest` to generate a shipping manifest and "
"streamline the pickup process."
msgstr ""
"Изберете :guilabel:`Генериране на манифест`, за да генерирате манифест за "
"доставка и да улесните процеса на вземане."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:123
msgid ""
"Select a :guilabel:`Payment Method`. Select :guilabel:`Prepaid` to pay for "
"labels using Shiprocket account funds. Select cash on delivery "
"(:guilabel:`COD`) to ensure the receiver pays for the shipment when they "
"receive it."
msgstr ""
"Изберете :guilabel:`Payment Method`. Изберете :guilabel:`Prepaid`, за да "
"платите за етикетите чрез средствата в акаунта на Shiprocket. Изберете "
"наложен платеж (:guilabel:`COD`), за да гарантирате, че получателят плаща за"
" пратката при получаването ѝ."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:128
msgid ""
"For **both** :guilabel:`Payment Method` selections, Shiprocket account funds"
" are deducted."
msgstr ""
"И при **двата** избора на :guilabel:`Payment Method` се удържат средства от "
"акаунта на Shiprocket."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:130
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`COD` is selected, the payment collected upon delivery is "
"remitted according to Shiprocket's settlement cycle."
msgstr ""
"Ако е избрано :guilabel:`COD`, платежната сума, събрана при доставката, се "
"превежда според цикъла на разплащане на Shiprocket."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:133
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Package Type` field, select a package dimension to use for"
" shipments."
msgstr ""
"В полето :guilabel:`Тип пакет` изберете размер на пакета, който да се "
"използва за пратките."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:135
msgid ""
"To retrieve the list of supported Shiprocket couriers, click the :icon:`fa-"
"refresh` :guilabel:`(Sync Couriers from Shiprocket)` icon next to the "
":guilabel:`Shiprocket Couriers` field. Select the couriers to use in the "
":guilabel:`Shiprocket Couriers` field. If this field is left blank, Odoo "
"selects the first courier based on the :ref:`courier priority "
"<inventory/shiprocket/enable-couriers>` set in the Shiprocket portal."
msgstr ""
"За да извлечете списъка с поддържаните куриери на Shiprocket, кликнете върху"
" иконата :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`(Sync Couriers from Shiprocket)` до "
"полето :guilabel:`Shiprocket Couriers`. Изберете куриерите, които да се "
"използват в полето :guilabel:`Shiprocket Couriers`. Ако това поле е оставено"
" празно, Odoo избира първия куриер въз основа на :ref:`приоритета на "
"куриерите <inventory/shiprocket/enable-couriers>`, зададен в портала на "
"Shiprocket."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:141
msgid ""
"To retrieve the list of Shiprocket channels, click the :icon:`fa-refresh` "
":guilabel:`(Sync Channel from Shiprocket)` icon next to the "
":guilabel:`Shiprocket Channel` field. In the :guilabel:`Shiprocket Channel` "
"field, select the sales channel that was created in the "
":ref:`inventory/shiprocket/sales-channel` step."
msgstr ""
"За да извлечете списъка с канали на Shiprocket, кликнете върху иконата "
":icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`(Синхронизиране на канал от Shiprocket)` до "
"полето :guilabel:`Канал на Shiprocket`. В полето :guilabel:`Канал на "
"Shiprocket` изберете канала за продажби, който беше създаден в стъпката "
":ref:`inventory/shiprocket/sales-channel`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:None
msgid "Complete the fields of the form to make the shipping method available."
msgstr ""
"Попълнете полетата на формуляра, за да направите метода на доставка "
"достъпен."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:150
msgid "Availability tab"
msgstr "Раздел Наличност"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:152
msgid ""
"Use the *Availability* tab to specify the :guilabel:`Countries` to which the"
" shipping method should apply. Shiprocket supports deliveries to over 220 "
"countries."
msgstr ""
"Използвайте раздела *Наличност*, за да посочите :guilabel:`Държави`, за "
"които трябва да се прилага методът на доставка. Shiprocket поддържа доставки"
" до над 220 държави."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:158
msgid ""
"To use Shiprocket to generate shipping labels, the following information "
"**must** be filled out accurately and completely in Odoo:"
msgstr ""
"За да използвате Shiprocket за генериране на етикети за доставка, следната "
"информация **трябва** да бъде попълнена точно и изцяло в Odoo:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:164
msgid ""
"To verify, select the :guilabel:`Customer` field to open their contact page."
" Add their shipping address in the :guilabel:`Contact` field, along with "
"their :guilabel:`Mobile` number and :guilabel:`Email` address."
msgstr ""
"За да проверите, изберете полето :guilabel:`Клиент`, за да отворите "
"страницата им за контакт. Добавете адреса им за доставка в полето "
":guilabel:`Контакт`, заедно с номера им за :guilabel:`Мобилен телефон` и "
"адреса за :guilabel:`Имейл`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:167
msgid ""
"**Product weight**: Ensure all products in a delivery order have a specified"
" :guilabel:`Weight` in the *Inventory* tab of their product form. Refer to "
"the :ref:`inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-weight` documentation for "
"detailed instructions."
msgstr ""
"**Тегло на продукта**: Уверете се, че всички продукти в поръчка за доставка "
"имат посочено :guilabel:`Тегло` в раздела *Складова наличност* на формуляра "
"на продукта. Вижте документацията "
":ref:`inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-weight` за подробни инструкции."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:170
msgid ""
"**Warehouse address**: By default all packages are sent from the specified "
"address in the warehouse. Make sure to set the :guilabel:`Address` in the "
"warehouse form."
msgstr ""
"**Адрес на склада**: По подразбиране всички опаковки се изпращат от "
"посочения адрес в склада. Уверете се, че сте задали :guilabel:`Address` във "
"формата на склада."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:174
msgid "Generate a Shiprocket label"
msgstr "Генериране на етикет на Shiprocket"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:176
msgid ""
"When a quotation is created in Odoo, add the Shiprocket shipping method by "
"clicking the :guilabel:`Add shipping` button."
msgstr ""
"Когато в Odoo се създава оферта, добавете метода за доставка Shiprocket, "
"като кликнете върху бутона :guilabel:`Add shipping`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:179
msgid ""
"In the *Add a shipping method* pop-up window, select :guilabel:`Shiprocket` "
"in the :guilabel:`Shipping Method` field. Calculate the shipping rate by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Get rate`. Finally, click :guilabel:`Add` to include the"
" cost of shipping to the sales order line, labeled as the *delivery "
"product*."
msgstr ""
"В изскачащия прозорец *Add a shipping method* изберете "
":guilabel:`Shiprocket` в полето :guilabel:`Shipping Method`. Изчислете "
"таксата за доставка, като кликнете върху :guilabel:`Get rate`. Накрая "
"кликнете върху :guilabel:`Add`, за да включите разхода за доставка в реда на"
" продажбената поръчка, обозначен като *продукт за доставка*."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:None
msgid "Add Shiprocket shipping to a sales order."
msgstr "Добавяне на доставка чрез Shiprocket към поръчка за продажба."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:188
msgid ""
"Shipping costs for Shiprocket can be automatically generated in both the "
"**Sales** and **eCommerce** applications."
msgstr ""
"Разходите за доставка за Shiprocket могат да се генерират автоматично както "
"в приложението **Sales**, така и в приложението **eCommerce**."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:191
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:212
msgid ""
"Then, :guilabel:`Validate` the delivery. Shipping label documents are "
"automatically generated in the chatter, which includes the following:"
msgstr ""
"След това :guilabel:`Валидирайте` доставката. Документите с етикети за "
"доставка се генерират автоматично в chatter, който включва следното:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:194
msgid "**Shipping labels**, depending on the number of packages"
msgstr "**Етикети за доставка**, в зависимост от броя опаковки"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:195
msgid "**Tracking numbers**, if the selected courier supports it"
msgstr "**Номера за проследяване**, ако избраният куриер ги поддържа"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:None
msgid "After the delivery is validated, a label is generated."
msgstr "След като доставката бъде валидирана, се генерира етикет."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:201
msgid ""
"If the shipment is too heavy for the Shiprocket service that is configured, "
"the weight is split to simulate multiple packages. Products must be put in "
"different packages to validate the transfer and generate labels."
msgstr ""
"Ако пратката е твърде тежка за конфигурираната услуга на Shiprocket, теглото"
" се разделя, за да се симулират множество опаковки. Продуктите трябва да "
"бъдат поставени в различни опаковки, за да се валидира трансферът и да се "
"генерират етикети."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:206
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:250
msgid "Cancellations"
msgstr "Анулирания"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:208
msgid ""
"If a delivery order is cancelled in Odoo, it is automatically archived in "
"Shiprocket. However, cancellation notices are not sent to the courier "
"itself, so make sure to log in to the courier's platform to handle the "
"cancellation manually."
msgstr ""
"Ако нареждане за доставка бъде анулирано в Odoo, то автоматично се архивира "
"в Shiprocket. Известията за анулиране обаче не се изпращат до самия куриер, "
"така че се уверете, че сте влезли в платформата на куриера, за да обработите"
" анулирането ръчно."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:213
msgid "Turn on Shiprocket integration"
msgstr "Активиране на интеграцията с Shiprocket"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:215
msgid ""
"After the Shiprocket connection is set up, use the smart buttons at the top "
"of the form to publish, turn on production mode, or activate debug logging."
msgstr ""
"След като връзката с Shiprocket е настроена, използвайте интелигентните "
"бутони в горната част на формуляра, за да публикувате, да включите "
"производствен режим или да активирате логване за отстраняване на грешки."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:218
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unpublished/Published`: Click this smart button to make this "
"shipping method available on the **eCommerce** website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Непубликувано/Публикувано`: Кликнете върху този интелигентен "
"бутон, за да направите този метод на доставка достъпен на уебсайта за "
"**Електронна търговия**."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:220
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Test Environment/Production Environment`: Click this smart button"
" to specify that labels are for testing only and cancelled immediately "
"(Test) or that real shipping labels can be generated and charged to the "
"Shiprocket account (Production). In the Test environment, the amount of the "
"cancelled shipment is refunded in 3 to 4 days."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Test Environment/Production Environment`: Кликнете върху този "
"смарт бутон, за да посочите дали етикетите са само за тестване и се анулират"
" незабавно (Test), или могат да се генерират реални етикети за доставка, "
"начислявани на акаунта на Shiprocket (Production). В тестовата среда сумата "
"на анулираната пратка се възстановява в рамките на 3 до 4 дни."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:224
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No Debug/Debug Requests`: Click this smart button to specify "
"whether API requests and responses are logged in Odoo (:doc:`turn on "
"developer mode <../../../../general/developer_mode>` and go to "
":menuselection:`Settings app --> Technical --> Logging`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Без дебъг/Дебъг заявки`: Кликнете върху този интелигентен бутон, "
"за да посочите дали заявките и отговорите на API се логват в Odoo "
"(:doc:`активирайте режим на разработчик "
"<../../../../general/developer_mode>` и отидете на :menuselection:`Настройки"
" --> Технически --> Логове`)."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:3
msgid "Starshipit shipping"
msgstr "Доставка чрез Starshipit"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:5
msgid ""
"Starshipit is a shipping service operator that facilitates the integration "
"of Australasian shipping couriers with Odoo. Once integrated, users can "
"create shipping methods that will automatically get rates from specific "
"couriers (such as Australia Post, NZ Post, DHL,...) based on predefined "
"conditions."
msgstr ""
"Starshipit е оператор на услуги за доставка, който улеснява интеграцията на "
"австралазийски куриери за доставка с Odoo. След интегрирането потребителите "
"могат да създават методи на доставка, които автоматично получават тарифи от "
"конкретни куриери (като Australia Post, NZ Post, DHL,...) въз основа на "
"предварително зададени условия."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:11
msgid ":doc:`Automatically calculate shipping <../setup_configuration>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Автоматично изчисляване на доставката <../setup_configuration>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`Integrate other third-party couriers <third_party_shipper>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Интегриране на други куриери от трети страни <third_party_shipper>`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:15
msgid "Setup in Starshipit"
msgstr "Настройка в Starshipit"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:18
msgid "Create an account and activate couriers"
msgstr "Създаване на акаунт и активиране на куриери"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:20
msgid ""
"To get started, go to `Starshipit's platform <https://starshipit.com/>`_ to "
"configure the account and generate the connector credentials. Log in with "
"the Starshipit account, or create a new one if needed."
msgstr ""
"За да започнете, отидете на `платформата на Starshipit "
"<https://starshipit.com/>`_, за да конфигурирате акаунта и да генерирате "
"идентификационните данни за конектора. Влезте с акаунта в Starshipit, или "
"създайте нов, ако е необходимо."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:25
msgid "Pickup address configuration"
msgstr "Конфигуриране на адрес за вземане"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:27
msgid ""
"Once logged into the Starshipit account, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Pickup address`, and fill in the "
":guilabel:`Pickup address`. Ensure this field matches the warehouse address."
msgstr ""
"След като влезете в акаунта в Starshipit, отидете на "
":menuselection:`Настройки --> Адрес за вземане`, и попълнете "
":guilabel:`Адрес за вземане`. Уверете се, че това поле съответства на адреса"
" на склада."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:None
#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:None
msgid "Adding addresses in the Starshipit settings."
msgstr "Добавяне на адреси в настройките на Starshipit."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:35
msgid "Couriers configuration"
msgstr "Конфигуриране на куриери"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:37
msgid ""
"To integrate with third-party couriers, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings"
" --> Couriers`, and select :guilabel:`Couriers`."
msgstr ""
"За да интегрирате куриери от трети страни, отидете на "
":menuselection:`Настройки --> Куриери`, и изберете :guilabel:`Куриери`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:45
msgid ""
"For details on integrating with different couriers, refer to `Starshipit's "
"support center <https://support.starshipit.com/hc/en-us/>`_."
msgstr ""
"За подробности относно интегрирането с различни куриери вижте `центъра за "
"поддръжка на Starshipit <https://support.starshipit.com/hc/en-us/>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:49
msgid "Checkout rates"
msgstr "Тарифи при плащане"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:51
msgid ""
"To configure shipping rate calculations, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Checkout rates`. The selected delivery costs "
"are automatically applied in Odoo when calculating shipping costs."
msgstr ""
"За да конфигурирате изчисленията на тарифите за доставка, отидете на "
":menuselection:`Настройки --> Тарифи при плащане`. Избраните разходи за "
"доставка се прилагат автоматично в Odoo при изчисляване на разходите за "
"доставка."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:None
msgid "Checkout rates in the Starshipit settings."
msgstr "Тарифи при плащане в настройките на Starshipit."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:59
msgid "Starshipit API key"
msgstr "API ключ на Starshipit"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:61
msgid ""
"Configure shipping rules to assign the correct shipping methods to orders "
"based on specific conditions."
msgstr ""
"Конфигурирайте правила за доставка, за да присвоите правилните методи на "
"доставка на поръчките въз основа на конкретни условия."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:64
msgid ""
"To create a rule, go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Rules` and click "
":guilabel:`Add a new rule`."
msgstr ""
"За да създадете правило, отидете на :menuselection:`Настройки --> Правила` и"
" кликнете върху :guilabel:`Добавяне на ново правило`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:66
msgid ""
"While there are multiple ways to configure rules, it is recommended to set:"
msgstr ""
"Въпреки че съществуват множество начини за конфигуриране на правила, "
"препоръчително е да зададете:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:68
msgid ":guilabel:`Condition` to :guilabel:`Contains`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Условие` на :guilabel:`Съдържа`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:69
msgid ":guilabel:`Value` to the :guilabel:`product code`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Стойност` на :guilabel:`код на продукта`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:70
msgid ":guilabel:`Action` to :guilabel:`Set Courier & Product Code`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Действие` на :guilabel:`Задаване на куриер и код на продукта`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:None
msgid "Shipping rules in the Starshipit settings."
msgstr "Правила за доставка в настройките на Starshipit."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:79
msgid "Finding Starshipit API credentials"
msgstr "Намиране на идентификационните данни за API на Starshipit"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:81
msgid ""
"In the Starshipit account, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings --> API` in "
"the side menu. This page contains the :abbr:`API (Application Programming "
"Interface)` keys needed to connect to Odoo."
msgstr ""
"В акаунта на Starshipit отидете на :menuselection:`Настройки --> API` в "
"страничното меню. Тази страница съдържа :abbr:`API (Application Programming "
"Interface)` ключовете, необходими за свързване с Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:None
msgid "Finding the Starshipit API keys."
msgstr "Намиране на API ключовете на Starshipit."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:93
msgid "Install the Starshipit module"
msgstr "Инсталиране на модула Starshipit"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:95
msgid ""
"After the Starshipit account is set up, integrate it with the Odoo database."
" To do that, go to Odoo's :guilabel:`Apps` module, search for the "
":guilabel:`Starshipit Shipping` module, and click :guilabel:`Activate` to "
"install it."
msgstr ""
"След като акаунтът в Starshipit е настроен, интегрирайте го с базата данни "
"на Odoo. За да направите това, отидете на модула :guilabel:`Приложения` на "
"Odoo, потърсете модула :guilabel:`Starshipit Shipping`, и кликнете върху "
":guilabel:`Активиране`, за да го инсталирате."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:None
msgid "Starshipit Shipping module in the Odoo Apps module."
msgstr "Модулът Starshipit Shipping в модула Odoo Apps."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:104
msgid "Configure a Starshipit delivery method"
msgstr "Конфигуриране на метод за доставка Starshipit"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:106
msgid ""
"Once installed, activate the feature by going to :menuselection:`Inventory "
"--> Configuration --> Settings`. Under the :guilabel:`Shipping Connectors` "
"section, activate the :guilabel:`Starshipit Connector` option."
msgstr ""
"След инсталирането активирайте функцията, като отидете на "
":menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`. В секцията "
":guilabel:`Shipping Connectors` активирайте опцията :guilabel:`Starshipit "
"Connector`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:110
msgid ""
"After activating :guilabel:`Starshipit Connector`, click the "
":guilabel:`Starshipit Shipping Methods` link below the listed connector. "
"Once on the :guilabel:`Delivery Methods` page, click :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"След активирането на :guilabel:`Starshipit Connector`, щракнете върху "
"връзката :guilabel:`Starshipit Shipping Methods` под изброения конектор. "
"След като сте на страницата :guilabel:`Delivery Methods`, щракнете върху "
":guilabel:`Create`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:115
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Methods` can also be accessed by going to "
":menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Delivery --> Delivery "
"Methods`."
msgstr ""
"До :guilabel:`Delivery Methods` може да се достигне също и чрез "
":menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Delivery --> Delivery "
"Methods`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:118
msgid ""
"Configure a Starshipit delivery method in Odoo by filling out the fields on "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Methods` form as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Конфигурирайте метод за доставка Starshipit в Odoo, като попълните полетата "
"във формуляра :guilabel:`Delivery Methods`, както следва:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:121
msgid ":guilabel:`Delivery Method`: type `Starshipit`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Delivery Method`: въведете `Starshipit`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:122
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Provider`: select :guilabel:`Starshipit` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Provider`: изберете :guilabel:`Starshipit` от падащото меню."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:123
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Product`: assign or create the delivery product that "
"will appear on the sales order line when the cost of shipping is computed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Product`: задайте или създайте продукта за доставка, "
"който ще се появи на реда на поръчката за продажба, когато се изчисли "
"стойността на доставката."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:127
msgid ""
"The fields discussed in this section are specific to configuring Starshipit."
" For more information about the other fields, refer to "
":doc:`../setup_configuration`."
msgstr ""
"Полетата, разгледани в този раздел, са специфични за конфигурирането на "
"Starshipit. За повече информация относно останалите полета вижте "
":doc:`../setup_configuration`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:130
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Starshipit Configuration` tab, fill out these fields:"
msgstr ""
"В раздела :guilabel:`Starshipit Configuration` попълнете следните полета:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Starshipit API Key`: enter the :abbr:`API (Application "
"Programming Interface)` key :ref:`obtained from Starshipit "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/star-api>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Starshipit API Key`: въведете ключа :abbr:`API (Application "
"Programming Interface)`, :ref:`получен от Starshipit "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/star-api>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:134
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Starshipit Subscription Key`: enter the subscription key obtained"
" from the same place as the :ref:`API key "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/star-api>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Starshipit Subscription Key`: въведете ключа за абонамент, "
"получен от същото място като :ref:`API ключа "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/star-api>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:136
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Origin Address`: Enter the address where products are shipped "
"from. This field is crucial for calculating shipping rates and "
":ref:`generating shipping labels <inventory/shipping_receiving/star-label>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Origin Address`: Въведете адреса, от който се изпращат "
"продуктите. Това поле е от решаващо значение за изчисляването на тарифите за"
" доставка и :ref:`генерирането на етикети за доставка "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/star-label>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Package Type`: Set a default package type to include the "
"weight of the empty package when automatically calculating shipping rates."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Default Package Type`: Задайте тип опаковка по подразбиране, за "
"да се включва теглото на празната опаковка при автоматичното изчисляване на "
"тарифите за доставка."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:143
msgid ""
"To set a default package type, the *Packages* feature **must** be enabled in"
" :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"За да зададете тип опаковка по подразбиране, функцията *Packages* **трябва**"
" да бъде активирана в :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:146
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Save manually)` icon at the "
"top of the page to save the changes."
msgstr ""
"Щракнете върху иконата :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Save manually)` в"
" горната част на страницата, за да запазите промените."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:148
msgid ""
"To load the newly configured shipping products, click :guilabel:`Select a "
"service linked to your starshipit account` at the bottom of the "
":guilabel:`Starshipit Configuration` tab, and a :guilabel:`Choose Starshipit"
" Shipping Service` pop-up window appears. In the :guilabel:`Delivery "
"Service` field, select the desired shipping service for deliveries and "
"returns from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"За да заредите новоконфигурираните продукти за доставка, щракнете върху "
":guilabel:`Select a service linked to your starshipit account` в долната "
"част на раздела :guilabel:`Starshipit Configuration`, при което се появява "
"изскачащ прозорец :guilabel:`Choose Starshipit Shipping Service`. В полето "
":guilabel:`Delivery Service` изберете желаната услуга за доставка за пратки "
"и връщания от падащото меню."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:154
msgid ""
"The list of services shown during initial configuration may be incomplete. "
"Starshipit determines service availability based on shipment details such as"
" the destination address and package weight, which are not yet available at "
"this stage. To select from the full list of services available for a "
"specific order, use the :guilabel:`Get more delivery methods` option "
"directly from the sales order. See :ref:`inventory/shipping_receiving/star-"
"label` for details."
msgstr ""
"Списъкът с услуги, показан по време на първоначалната конфигурация, може да "
"е непълен. Starshipit определя наличността на услугите въз основа на данни "
"за пратката, като адреса на местоназначение и теглото на опаковката, които "
"все още не са налични на този етап. За да изберете от пълния списък с "
"налични услуги за конкретна поръчка, използвайте опцията :guilabel:`Get more"
" delivery methods` директно от поръчката за продажба. Вижте "
":ref:`inventory/shipping_receiving/star-label` за подробности."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:160
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm` and the selected delivery service populates in the"
" :guilabel:`Shipping Method` and :guilabel:`Starshipit Service Code` fields."
msgstr ""
"Щракнете върху :guilabel:`Confirm` и избраната услуга за доставка се попълва"
" в полетата :guilabel:`Shipping Method` и :guilabel:`Starshipit Service "
"Code`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:163
msgid "Sample of a Starshipit shipping product configured in Odoo:"
msgstr "Пример за продукт за доставка на Starshipit, конфигуриран в Odoo:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Sendle: Sendle drop off`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Sendle: Sendle drop off`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Shipping Product`: `Sendle Delivery`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Shipping Product`: `Sendle Delivery`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Starshipit Service Code`: `STANDARD-DROPOFF`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Starshipit Service Code`: `STANDARD-DROPOFF`"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:174
msgid ""
"Starshipit does not provide test keys when a company tests the sending of a "
"package in Odoo. This means that if a package is created, the account may be"
" charged."
msgstr ""
"Starshipit не предоставя тестови ключове, когато дадена компания тества "
"изпращането на пратка в Odoo. Това означава, че ако бъде създадена пратка, "
"сметката може да бъде таксувана."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:177
msgid ""
"Odoo has a built-in layer of protection against unwanted charges when using "
"test environments. Within a test environment, if a shipping method is used "
"to create labels, then those labels are immediately cancelled after creation"
" — this occurs automatically. Please note that depending on the shipping "
"provider being used, the account might be charged for printing label, unless"
" the order is cancelled manually on the couriers’s portal."
msgstr ""
"Odoo разполага с вграден слой на защита срещу нежелани такси при използване "
"на тестови среди. В тестова среда, ако даден метод за доставка се използва "
"за създаване на етикети, тези етикети незабавно се анулират след създаването"
" им — това се случва автоматично. Моля, имайте предвид, че в зависимост от "
"използвания доставчик на доставки, сметката може да бъде таксувана за "
"отпечатването на етикета, освен ако поръчката не бъде анулирана ръчно в "
"портала на куриера."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:184
msgid ""
"Switch between the test and production environment by clicking the "
":guilabel:`Environment` smart button at the top of the shipping method form."
msgstr ""
"Превключвайте между тестовата и продукционната среда, като щракнете върху "
"интелигентния бутон :guilabel:`Environment` в горната част на формуляра за "
"метода на доставка."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:190
msgid "Generate a label with Starshipit"
msgstr "Генериране на етикет със Starshipit"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:192
msgid ""
"When creating a quotation in Odoo, add the Starshipit shipping method by "
"clicking the :guilabel:`Add shipping` button."
msgstr ""
"При създаване на оферта в Odoo добавете метода за доставка Starshipit, като "
"щракнете върху бутона :guilabel:`Add shipping`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:196
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Add a shipping method` pop-up window, select a Starshipit "
"shipping method in the :guilabel:`Shipping Method` field."
msgstr ""
"В изскачащия прозорец :guilabel:`Add a shipping method` изберете метод за "
"доставка Starshipit в полето :guilabel:`Shipping Method`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:199
msgid ""
"If the desired service is not available, click :guilabel:`Get more delivery "
"methods`. This sends the actual order details (including the destination "
"address, weight, and volume) to Starshipit, which returns the complete list "
"of services available for that specific shipment. A new Starshipit delivery "
"method is then created automatically and selected in the :guilabel:`Shipping"
" Method` field."
msgstr ""
"Ако желаната услуга не е налична, щракнете върху :guilabel:`Get more "
"delivery methods`. Това изпраща действителните данни за поръчката "
"(включително адреса на местоназначение, теглото и обема) към Starshipit, "
"който връща пълния списък с услуги, налични за тази конкретна пратка. След "
"това автоматично се създава нов метод за доставка Starshipit, който се "
"избира в полето :guilabel:`Shipping Method`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:204
msgid ""
"Calculate the shipping rate by clicking :guilabel:`Get rate`. Finally, click"
" :guilabel:`Add` to include the cost of shipping to the sales order line, "
"labeled as the *delivery product*."
msgstr ""
"Изчислете тарифата за доставка, като щракнете върху :guilabel:`Get rate`. "
"Накрая щракнете върху :guilabel:`Add`, за да включите стойността на "
"доставката в реда на поръчката за продажба, обозначен като *продукт за "
"доставка*."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:209
msgid ""
"Automatically calculate shipping costs for Starshipit in **both** Odoo "
"*Sales* and *eCommerce* applications."
msgstr ""
"Автоматично изчисляване на разходите за доставка за Starshipit в **двете** "
"приложения на Odoo — *Sales* и *eCommerce*."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:216
msgid ":guilabel:`Tracking number(s)` if the selected courier supports it."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Tracking number(s)`, ако избраният куриер го поддържа."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:217
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Return label(s)` if the Starshipit connector is configured for "
"returns."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Return label(s)`, ако конекторът Starshipit е конфигуриран за "
"връщания."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:None
msgid "Example of a shipped order in Odoo."
msgstr "Пример за изпратена поръчка в Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:224
msgid ""
"Package weight in Odoo is calculated by adding the weights of the products "
"plus the empty package saved in the database. Ensure the correct shipping "
"option is selected, as the package weight is not automatically verified."
msgstr ""
"Теглото на опаковката в Odoo се изчислява чрез сумиране на теглата на "
"продуктите плюс теглото на празната опаковка, запазено в базата данни. "
"Уверете се, че е избрана правилната опция за доставка, тъй като теглото на "
"опаковката не се проверява автоматично."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:228
msgid ""
"Verify the destination address, as Starshipit checks it when the order is "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Проверете адреса на местоназначение, тъй като Starshipit го проверява при "
"създаването на поръчката."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:230
msgid ""
"Finally, some couriers may require other information, such as an email "
"address or phone number. Please ensure that all necessary information are "
"set upon sending a shipping order."
msgstr ""
"Накрая, някои куриери може да изискват друга информация, като имейл адрес "
"или телефонен номер. Моля, уверете се, че цялата необходима информация е "
"зададена при изпращането на поръчка за доставка."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:234
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "Връщания"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:243
msgid "Starshipit allows returns with the following couriers:"
msgstr "Starshipit позволява връщания със следните куриери:"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:237
msgid "Australia Post eParcel"
msgstr "Australia Post eParcel"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:238
msgid "TNT"
msgstr "TNT"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:239
msgid "Couriers Please"
msgstr "Couriers Please"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:240
msgid "Aramex"
msgstr "Aramex"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:241
msgid "StarTrack"
msgstr "StarTrack"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:242
msgid "DHL Express"
msgstr "DHL Express"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:243
msgid "NZ Post Domestic"
msgstr "NZ Post Domestic"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:245
msgid ""
"This can be done by clicking the :guilabel:`Return` smart button on the "
"intended delivery order. If the selected courier supports returns, the "
":guilabel:`Print Return Label` button will be available."
msgstr ""
"Това може да се направи, като щракнете върху интелигентния бутон "
":guilabel:`Return` на желаната поръчка за доставка. Ако избраният куриер "
"поддържа връщания, ще бъде наличен бутонът :guilabel:`Print Return Label`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:252
msgid ""
"If a delivery order is cancelled in Odoo, it will be automatically archived "
"in Starshipit. However, the cancellation will not be sent to the courier "
"itself, so make sure to log onto the courier's platform to handle the "
"cancellation manually."
msgstr ""
"Ако поръчка за доставка бъде анулирана в Odoo, тя автоматично се архивира в "
"Starshipit. Анулирането обаче няма да бъде изпратено до самия куриер, така "
"че се уверете, че сте влезли в платформата на куриера, за да обработите "
"анулирането ръчно."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:3
msgid "Third-party shipping carriers"
msgstr "Външни превозвачи за доставка"

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:10
msgid ""
"Users can link third-party shipping carriers to Odoo databases, in order to "
"verify carriers' delivery to specific addresses, :doc:`automatically "
"calculate shipping costs <../setup_configuration>`, and :doc:`generate "
"shipping labels <labels>`."
msgstr ""
"Потребителите могат да свързват външни превозвачи за доставка с базите данни"
" на Odoo, за да проверяват доставката на превозвачите до конкретни адреси, "
"да :doc:`изчисляват автоматично разходите за доставка "
"<../setup_configuration>` и да :doc:`генерират етикети за доставка "
"<labels>`."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/third_party_shipper.rst:14
msgid ""
"In Odoo, shipping carriers can be applied to a sales order (SO), invoice, or"
" delivery order. For tips on resolving common issues when configuring "
"shipping connectors, skip to the :ref:`Troubleshooting "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/third-party-troubles>` section."
msgstr ""
"В Odoo превозвачите за доставка могат да се прилагат към поръчка за продажба"
" (SO), фактура или поръчка за доставка. За съвети относно разрешаването на "
"често срещани проблеми при конфигурирането на конектори за доставка, "
"преминете направо към раздела :ref:`Отстраняване на неизправности "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/third-party-troubles>`."

